  "description": "\"As of today, I will personally handle the interrogation of First Lieutenant Sophia Yu.\" \n\nMajor Louis Kane, the most respected and flawless hero within the military. \n\n\"Just think about surviving. Isn't there someone you need to meet?\" \n\nJi-yeon's chin is grabbed, and their gazes lock. This man, who drove me to the edge of a cliff, is the worst. But if it means surviving—I will gladly shatter this man's rationality. The moment their lips touch, the tables are turned. Enemy prisoner vs. Military powerhouse. The most intense romance born from a breathless hate-to-love relationship. Reason collapses, and desire reacts first. This is not love; it's survival!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14941899)",
